WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.490
March 1979.

2
00:00:01.540 --> 00:00:05.250
Shenzhen is established,
in the Pearl River Delta,

3
00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:07.110
beside Hong Kong.

4
00:00:07.160 --> 00:00:11.930
In August 1980, it became China's
first special economic zone.

5
00:00:11.980 --> 00:00:18.110
By the end of 2024, it had 17.98
million permanent residents.

6
00:00:18.160 --> 00:00:20.110
So where did they all come from?

7
00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:21.410
Births in the city?

8
00:00:21.460 --> 00:00:22.770
Immigrants from abroad?

9
00:00:22.820 --> 00:00:24.330
A redrawn boundary?

10
00:00:24.380 --> 00:00:27.810
In this mission, you'll learn the
three engines of urban growth,

11
00:00:27.860 --> 00:00:31.890
and see how the world
has urbanised since 1950.

12
00:00:31.940 --> 00:00:34.450
Then you'll follow people
back into inner cities,

13
00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:39.130
through gentrification in New
York, and look ahead to 2050.

14
00:00:39.180 --> 00:00:42.840
Your mission: find out where
Shenzhen's millions came from.
